Third-Party Audio Stimuli

The audio stimuli files included in this repository are sourced from the qVCV project by Boys Town National Research Hospital. For information on the exact licensing and terms of use for these audio files, please refer to their original repository: 
https://github.com/BoysTownOrg/qVCV

---

Medical & Hardware Disclaimer

The hearing tests and algorithms in this repository are currently being evaluated for equivalence to clinical audiometry, with promising results in controlled environments using calibrated hardware. However, because this web application cannot control the end-user's acoustic environment, audio hardware, or volume levels, results obtained outside of a controlled clinical setting should not be used for medical diagnosis or clinical decision-making. If you have concerns about your hearing, please consult a qualified healthcare professional.
